WEBVTT

00:13:25.133 --> 00:13:30.389
not only the ask to shift that
for our communities,

00:13:30.389 --> 00:13:32.099
but also those values.

00:13:32.766 --> 00:13:36.436
So I ask you, I invite you
to join me in this,

00:13:36.478 --> 00:13:38.730
and I challenge you to go out

00:13:38.772 --> 00:13:41.191
and challenge our elected
leaders and others.

00:13:41.233 --> 00:13:43.694
And if they're not doing the right job,

00:13:43.735 --> 00:13:46.738
then tell them who the leaders are
that need to be there.

00:13:46.780 --> 00:13:49.700
We need frontline leaders
to be in the spaces.

00:13:50.284 --> 00:13:51.451
Thank you.

00:13:51.493 --> 00:13:54.872
(Applause)